        "original_id": "2d87b575-b9a2-538b-903d-cdb82abc6903",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sia, Nigel Corsbie, Sergei Prokofiev, Sergei O. Prokofieff, Oleg Prokofiev, Lina Prokofiev, Sofia Korovina\n- Works: Taken for Granted, Montagues and Capulets, Party Like a Russian\n\nFacts:\n- Sergei Prokofiev was a Russian composer who wrote the classical music work \"Montagues and Capulets.\"\n- \"Taken for Granted\" was written by Sia, produced by Nigel Corsbie, and heavily samples Sergei Prokofiev's \"Montagues and Capulets.\"\n- The chorus of \"Party Like a Russian\" samples Sergei Prokofiev's \"Montagues and Capulets.\"\n- Sergei O. Prokofieff was the grandson of composer Sergei Prokofiev and his first wife Lina Prokofiev.\n- Sergei O. Prokofieff was the son of Oleg Prokofiev and his first wife Sofia Korovina.",
